交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t81-6e-rest-_tj6f8_v/candidate/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-ok7akkq3/c-ucg_xqk_/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261015-1' '--attempt' 'a51de42a-a2fd-450d-95e4-3c22c425cb6c' '--session' '9dd2aeb2-1a64-4ece-b413-f69184d0cbef' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-15T09:30:55.598Z","task":"fixture-20261015-1","attempt":"a51de42a-a2fd-450d-95e4-3c22c425cb6c","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261015-1","attempt_id":"a51de42a-a2fd-450d-95e4-3c22c425cb6c","session_id":"9dd2aeb2-1a64-4ece-b413-f69184d0cbef","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"64131de8-4c13-409d-a3c0-72a6f0263d43","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"d8cccd60-8818-4624-9e51-9435f51ead54","thread":"64131de8-4c13-409d-a3c0-72a6f0263d43","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-d8cccd60-8818-4624-9e51-9435f51ead54"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-ok7akkq3/c-ucg_xqk_/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261015-1-a1","base_commit":"be035ded83a860fb1c827d2923ed8581bb4afb17","card_snapshot_id":"b52578f0-41bb-48aa-8271-d98d94fb5133","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261015-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-15T09:30:57.031Z","task":"fixture-20261015-1","attempt":"a51de42a-a2fd-450d-95e4-3c22c425cb6c","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-ok7akkq3/c-ucg_xqk_/repo","cat-file","-t","6e45bde601632e68ccf4d689196fba40b3928686"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-ok7akkq3/c-ucg_xqk_/repo"}},{"seq":29,"time":"2026-10-15T09:30:57.065Z","task":"fixture-20261015-1","attemp